{"lyrics":"[Chorus]\n[00:16.18]Her face ain't ever matching her persona, yeah\n[00:20.04]I mix Xanax with the strongest marijuana, yeah, uh\n[00:24.12]You want problems? I roll with them problem solvers, yeah, uh\n[00:28.26]I got six shots in this gun, it's a revolver, yeah, uh\n[00:32.28]Dye my hair on that bullshit, like Rodman, huh\n[00:36.56]I'm Mike Jordan, you ball like Craig Hodges, yeah\n[00:40.50]Feel like Drake, 'cause I started from the bottom\n[00:44.20]I keep two Magnums, a gun and a condom\n[Verse 1]\n[00:48.18]Wait, wait, they tryna set me up, huh\n[00:50.72]But they can't set me up, huh\n[00:52.74]My gun a sprinkler system, pull up to his block and I wet it up, huh\n[00:57.00]I'm on the ground off the Xanax and Perkies, I need me a pick me up, huh\n[01:01.06]I got so drunk last night bro'nem had to come pick me up, yeah\n[01:05.02]Swerve on a highway, huh\n[01:07.14]Living the highway, huh\n[01:09.14]She fuck her friend for the night, huh\n[01:11.22]She go the bi way, huh\n[01:13.28]She got the molly and champagne, told her to bring that shit my way, huh\n[01:17.40]We couldn't make it into the house, she sucked me in the driveway, huh\n[01:21.12]I never gave her the runaround\n[01:23.12]I'ma always keep a gun around\n[01:25.10]Heat on my hip like the sun around\n[01:27.16]Ball like the OKC Thunder round\n[01:29.20]Hennessy, I need a couple rounds\n[01:31.22]Moving no work, I got hella pounds\n[01:33.30]Fuck up a check, I got hella bands\n[01:35.34]Bandana on me like Taliban (Right), na-na-na-na-na\n[01:38.02]Motorola, Motorola, 'cause I love my trap phone\n[01:42.02]Feel like Batman when I'm robbin', 'cause I keep a bat phone\n[01:46.10]I've been trappin' in the basement, even when my mom home\n[01:50.22]Sorry, mama, but I gotta keep the fucking lights on, ayy\n[Chorus]\n[01:54.36]Her face ain't ever matching her persona, yeah, uh\n[01:58.50]I mix Xanax with the strongest marijuana, yeah, uh\n[02:02.58]You want problems? I roll with them problem solv